credits=intro('With thanks to the photographers','The people<br><em>behind the photographs.</em>','The imagery in this fictional portfolio belongs to the photographers credited below. Their work brings the concept to life.',crumb='Image credits')+'<section class="container credits-list" aria-label="Photographer credits">'+''.join(f'<article class="credit-row">{picture(key,sizes="120px")}<div><h2>{photographer}</h2><p>{alt}</p><a class="text-link" href="https://unsplash.com/photos/{photo_id}">Original photograph on Unsplash {arrow()}</a></div></article>' for key,(alt,photographer,photo_id) in PHOTOS.items())+'</section><section class="container prose-panel"><h2>Photography & the concept</h2><p>Maeve Arden is a fictional brand. These images demonstrate the design and gallery experience; they are not photographs made by Maeve Arden or Luke Brennan.</p><p>Images were downloaded and optimised locally as responsive AVIF and WebP files. The <a href="https://unsplash.com/license">Unsplash License</a> permits free commercial and non-commercial use. Full source records are included in the repository’s IMAGE-SOURCES.md.</p></section>'
